# AegisPulse local environment (PROJECT.md §10.4).
# Local:   `make env` -> scripts/dev/gen-local-secrets.sh fills every <generated> value (or `infisical export --env=local`).
# Dev/Prod: never use this file; every [secret] is synced from Infisical (env dev|prod) by the Operator.
# Section A configures the local compose infrastructure. Section B lists per-runtime variables; in compose,
# each runtime receives its own mapping of Section A values (added with the service skeletons in Phase 1).

